#: settings/config.kcfg:7
msgid "Display document categories (mimetypes) in the view"
msgstr "Dokmentkategorien (MIME-Typen) binnen Ansicht wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (displayMimeType), group (General Options)
