#: settings/config.kcfg:10
msgid ""
"If this option is set, the Document View will organize documents\n"
"        by their mimetype. If this option is not set, the Document View will not\n"
"        organize the open documents by type."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, wiest de Dokmentenansicht de Dokmenten in Koppeln\n"
"        na ehr MIME-Typ. Is dat ut, warrt de opmaakten Dokmenten nich\n"
"        na Typ tosamenkoppelt."

